    description: "Observed once, 2026-11-08, ./scripts/check-package-coverage core on branch jgstern-agent/fix/inherited-calls-site2-provenance (dev 77cca016e9 + one inherited_calls.py change): [core] FAILED with analyze/c_family.py:256, sketch.py:6657 and verify_claims.py:7319 uncovered. None of these files changed in that branch or in PRs #2089-#2094; I did not run the check on dev itself, so whether the gap predates them or is order-dependent is not established. Consequence: CI checks only changed files, so the gap stays invisible until someone edits one of these files, and that unrelated PR then fails coverage. Next step: rerun on clean dev, then add core-local tests (or find which other-package test covers each line)."  # bb7a
